        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "51. What do we learn about beauty in the digital arena?\nA) It dictates the taste of digital media. C) It has ushered in a new awakening.\nB) It has been in the making for years. D) It is defined by social media.",
